### Create ride request (replace TOKEN with a valid user JWT)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rides/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
  "pickup": { "lat": -1.2921, "lng": 36.8219 },
  "destination": { "lat": -1.295, "lng": 36.82 }
}

### Get nearby ride requests (replace DRIVER_TOKEN with driver JWT)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rides/nearby?lat=-1.2921&lng=36.8219&radius=2000
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_TOKEN

### Accept ride request (replace IDs and DRIVER_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rides/ROUTE_RIDE_ID/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_TOKEN

### Cancel ride request (pass user or driver token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rides/ROUTE_RIDE_ID/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Get user rides
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rides/user/USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
